          "title": "You'll want to know: хоронить",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "хоронить (khoronít) — \"to bury\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Его похоронили рядом с женой. Yevó pokhoroníli ryádom s zhenóy. He was buried next to his wife."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; perfective похоронить (pokhoronít)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "хоронить (khoronít) is an inherited Slavic verb whose older sense was \"to keep safe, to hide away\"; EtymDB lists no parent, and it is usually traced to Proto-Slavic xorniti."
            }
          ]
        },
